                <note rend="inline" type="source">894c.111/19: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Crane</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-01-08T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 8,
                                1921—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>10. Statements quoted in last sentence of your telegram 8, January 6, 5 p.m.,
                    refer to Shantung and Antung Railways.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
